    {
      "q": "Is the Maitland Service Centre accessible for people with disabilities?",
      "a": "The centre offers wheelchair access, entry at street level, on-site parking, and street parking. It also provides Auslan video remote interpreting, a hearing loop, quiet hour, and remote live captioning.",
